{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "愛知県出身22歳の岡本姫奈です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "せっかくのシルバーウィークなのに！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "雨ばかりで\n髪は広がるし 偏頭痛も起きるし"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ずーんと重い気分になっちゃうね🥲"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近のひなは\nツアーで食べ過ぎた分を取り戻すために、笑\n好きな音楽聞いて 歩きまくっています☂️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も29.30日のアンダーライブに向けて\n練習頑張ってたよ☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "セトリ的に\n過去一ハードなんじゃないかな、笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "毎日全身が痛いし\n汗だくになって食らいついてます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いいライブにするよ〜！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しみにしてください！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この間ねお仕事終わりに\nなおとかき氷食べて、カラオケに行った〜！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mobInptNq.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "片平里菜さんの「女の子は泣かない」を歌ってくれて本当に可愛かった〜🧸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひなはね〜\n「考えないようにする」歌った！\nもちろん声真似付き 笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "帰り道 アイス食べながら\n歩いて帰ったのも全部楽しかったな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "出会った時15歳だったのにね\nあっという間に20歳になって。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "時の流れの速さにびっくりします"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お互い大人になっても\n沢山ふざけあおうね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "出会えて幸せだよ🧸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日の1曲"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "やさしさで溢れるように /Flowerさん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "オーディションで歌った大切な曲🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "次会えるまであと一週間！！\n楽しみにしてるからね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏休みの写真まだあった🐊"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/moblP5Klg.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mobDfk2q0.jpg", "alt": ""}], "source": "official"}